ster +]</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "WP": <span style="color: [+ wp_colour +];">[+ agriculture_minister +]</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "NSDAP": <span style="color: [+ nsdap_colour +];">[+ agriculture_minister +]</span>?] [? if agriculture_minister_party == "SPD":<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "KPD":<span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DDP":<span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "Z":<span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Z**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "SAPD":<span style="color: [+ sapd_colour +];">**SAPD**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "USPD":<span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "ASPD":<span style="color: [+ aspd_colour +];">**ASPD**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "LVP":<span style="color: [+ lvp_colour +];">**LVP**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "BVP":<span style="color: [+ bvp_colour +];">**BVP**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DVP":<span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DNVP":<span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DNF":<span style="color: [+ dnf_colour +];">**DNF**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DAP":<span style="color: [+ dap_colour +];">**DAP**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DAP":<span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Z**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "I":<span style="color: [+ i_colour +];">**I**</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "Others":<span style="color: [+ i_colour +];">Others</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "DHP":<span style="color: [+ dhp_colour +];">DHP</span>?][? if agriculture_minister_party == "WP":<span style="color: [+ wp_colour +];">WP</span>?]

@demographics
go-to: menu

**Demographic Groups**

**Working Class**: The urban working class - blue-collar workers in factories, workshops, mines, and the like. Most are socialist, supporting either the SPD or KPD. They make up 40-50% of the popZation.

**Old Mittelstand**: The old middle class consists of independent artisans, shopkeepers, and small-time businesspeople. They tend to be conservative and are the strongest base for the far right. 10-15% of the popZation.

**New Mittelstand**: The new middle class consists of white-collar workers and government employees. This is the base of liberalism. 10-15% of the popZation.

**Rural**: Small and large farmers and independent rural workers. Protestant farmers often support the DNVP. 20-30% of the popZation.

**Catholics** are the largest religious minority, at about 30% of the popZation. They disproportionately support the Center Party (or the Bavarian People's Party in Bavaria).

**Jews** aNSDAPount for between 0.5% to 1% of the popZation, and tend to support liberal parties, particZarly us, although substantial numbers support the SPD or KPD.


